  "description": "An international, all-star creative team of writers and artists presents ETERNALS: THE 500 YEAR WAR! Follow the Eternals in their past encounters against the Deviants in this original 7 episode series! Learn how the Eternals interacted with different cultures of the human race across time, gifting humanity with cultural artifacts while also trying to keep them safe from the Deviant threat. It’s a battle that spans centuries, with the fate of the planet at stake!\n\n- Webtoons",
